agedy, furiously clenched against a reality that she cannot face and cannot deny; and then, over the ensuing years, as she emerges reluctantly, slowly allowing her memory to take her back through the rich and joyous life she’s mourning, from her family’s home in London, to the birth of her children, to the year she met her English husband at Cambridge, to her childhood in Colombo; all the while learning the difficult balance between the almost unbearable reminders of her loss and the need to keep her family, somehow, still alive within her\"--From publisher's website.","publicationYear":2013,"subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Death","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Disaster victims","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Family","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Indian Ocean Tsunami, 2004","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Bereavement","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Parents","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Widows","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Children","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-wave-sonali-deraniyagala"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Large